WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Your customer places an order.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.200
The pallet crosses the dock and every item reads itself.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.800
Something that doesn't belong on this truck? Flagged.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.400
Something missing? It tells you what.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.700
Close it, and it all goes to your ERP.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.100
And your customer gets exactly what they ordered.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.200
Horizon Warehouse.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.000
Let the dock catch the short shipment… not your customer.
